Yes.

00:52:14.800 --> 00:52:16.060
Not quite.

00:52:16.060 --> 00:52:18.460
Because when you say
they're equivalent,

00:52:18.460 --> 00:52:20.530
it actually doesn't
really-- it means that you

00:52:20.530 --> 00:52:22.210
have a very simple method.

00:52:22.210 --> 00:52:24.130
It says that once
you solve that,

00:52:24.130 --> 00:52:25.780
I have a simple
method to solve that.

00:52:25.780 --> 00:52:29.420
And that simple method is,
well, it's very simple.

00:52:29.420 --> 00:52:32.620
I take a solution of this,
which we could figure out real

00:52:32.620 --> 00:52:34.000
quickly but I'm not going to.

00:52:34.000 --> 00:52:37.887
But we take a solution of that,
actually, the solution of it

00:52:37.887 --> 00:52:39.220
because it's going to be unique.

00:52:39.220 --> 00:52:41.650
We take the solution
